\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Father of all, in whom alone
\par We live, and move, and breathe,
\par One bright celestial ray dart down,
\par And cheer Thy sons beneath.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. While in Thy word we search for Thee-
\par We search with trembling awe-
\par Open our eyes, and let us see
\par The wonders of Thy law.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Now let our darkness comprehend
\par The light that shines do clear;
\par Now the revealing Spirit send,
\par And give us ears to hear.
\par                            Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

